msgid "Five explicit memory domains"
msgstr "Five explicit memory domains"

msgid "The maintained normal memory generator accepts five explicit, nonempty, 32-byte-aligned reservations. Their Flash and RAM sums may be less than the physical capacity; the remaining tail stays unassigned, rather than becoming user memory. Overflow, overlap, malformed sizes and insufficient privileged MSP/static budget are rejected before generation. These are software reference reservations, not a product partition policy."
msgstr "The maintained normal memory generator accepts five explicit, nonempty, 32-byte-aligned reservations. Their Flash and RAM sums may be less than the physical capacity; the remaining tail stays unassigned, rather than becoming user memory. Overflow, overlap, malformed sizes and insufficient privileged MSP/static budget are rejected before generation. These are software reference reservations, not a product partition policy."

